<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id">- Bible en mashi du Congo</book>
  <para style="toc3">Gal</para>
  <para style="toc2">Bagalasiya</para>
  <para style="toc1">AMARUBA EMWA ABAGALASIYA</para>
  <para style="h">AMARUBA EMWA ABAGALASIYA</para>
  <para style="mt1">AMARUBA EMWA ABAGALASIYA<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">https:/ /www.academic-bible.com/en/online-bibles/novum-testamentum-graece-na-28/read-the-bible-text/ (05. 07. 2021).</char></note></para>
  <para style="imt1">Enshokolezi oku maruba emwa Abagalasiya</para>
  <para style="ip">Paolo ali mwîshogwa wa Nnâmahanga, Yezu wamuhugûlaga Emyanzi y’Akalembe ayigîriza (1). Okubà mukristu kurhali kushimba obwôrhere bw’Abayahudi (2); bulya okukembûlwa kuli ntâco, n’okurhakembûlwa nakwo kuli ntâco; akantu kagwêrhe akamalo, kuli kuhinduka ciremwa cihyâhya (5, 5-6; 6, 15). Omukristu akwânîne ayumve oku abemêzi boshi muli Kristu bakola bene Abrahamu. Ye Nnâmahanga ahâga endagâno omu buyêmêre mpu arhaciri Abramu, Larha-wa-lukengwa, ci Abrahamu, Îshe-wa-mbaga-mwandu. Ababatizibwe barhacirimwo kabôlo. Obuyêmêre buyimangira oku ciragâne ci arhali oku Irhegeko, bulya Irhegeko lirhâna misî ya kushimba amarhegeko (3). Erhi Nnâmahanga abona oku amango gayunjwîre arhuma Omugala, aburhwa n’omukazi, afîra ebyâha bîrhu, anafûka; n’abamuyêmîre bahâbwa Mûka wabarhabâla okushimba amarhegeko mafundikire omu irhegeko ly’obuzigire, barhali bajà ci bâna baburhe (4-5). Ngasi muguma acîhangâne kuyâka ebijiro bigalugalu by’omubiri ahêkwe na Mûka Mutagatîfu (5, 5-6. 13-6, 17).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Paolo acîmanyisa, anahâna omusingo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1"/>Paolo, ntumwa, arhali oku bulonza bw’abantu nîsi erhi oku bulagizi bw’omuntu, ci oku nshôkano ya Yezu Kristu na Nyamuzinda Îshe wamufûlaga omu bafù, <verse eid="GAL 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:2"/>nie na bene wîrhu boshi rhuli rhweshi, oku Ekleziya z’e Galasiya. <verse eid="GAL 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3"/>Kuli mwe engalo n’omurhûla gwa Larha Nnâmahanga na Nyakasane Yezu Kristu, <verse eid="GAL 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4"/>wacîhânaga nterekêro oku byâha bîrhu, mpu lyo arhurhenza omu bubî bw’er’igulu, nka kulya Larha Nyamuzinda alonza, <verse eid="GAL 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5"/>olya okayagirwa emyâka n’emyâka! Amen.<verse eid="GAL 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Emyanzi y’Akalembe ebà miguma yône</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6"/>Nsômîrwe kurhi mudwîrhe mwatwîka duba-duba ntya olya wammuhamagalaga omu nshôkano ya Kristu, mpu mushimbe eyindi-yindi myanzi y’akalembe; <verse eid="GAL 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7"/>n’obwo Emyanzi y’Akalembe erhabamwo kubiri. Ci hali abantu badwîrhe bammuhiramwo akavulindi n’okulonza okuhushikanya Emyanzi y’Akalembe ya Kristu. <verse eid="GAL 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8"/>Mâshi owankaderha mpu ammuyigîriza eyindi-yindi myanzi y’akalembe erhali nk’erya rhwammubwîrizagya, ciru akabà rhwêne nîsi erhi malahika wamanuka emalunga, oyo akahera! <verse eid="GAL 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9"/>Kulya rhwammubwîraga mîra, nashub’ikuderha buno: owammuyigîriza eyindi-yindi myanzi y’Akale­mbè erhali nk’erya mwayigîrizibagwa, oyôla erhi ali mukâge! <verse eid="GAL 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10"/>Omu kuderha ntyo, ka kusîmwa na bantu erhi kusîmwa na Nyamuzinda nnonzize? Ka bantu nnonza okusîmîsa? Acibâga bantu ncilonza okusîmîsa, singa ntabà mwambali wa Kristu.<verse eid="GAL 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="ms1">I. Paolo ashambala kurhi ayigîrizagya Emyanzi y’Akalembe</para>
  <para style="s1">Kristu wabwîrizagya Paolo Emyanzi y'Akalembe ayigîriza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11"/>Nêci, leki mmubwîre, bene wîrhu: Emyanzi y’Akalembe nyigîriza erhabà ya bantu; <verse eid="GAL 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12"/>bulya arhali muntu wayimpâga erhi kuyinyigîriza, ci Yezu Kristu yêne wayinfulûliraga. <verse eid="GAL 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13"/>Mwayumvîrhe baderha oku nayôrhaga mîra omu idini ly’Abayahudi, n’oku ntagwêrhe Lugero omu kulibuza Ekleziya ya Nyamuzinda n’omu kulonza okuyisherêza. <verse eid="GAL 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14"/>Omu idini ly’Abayahudi, nalusha bîrhu banji rhwakulaga rhweshi, bulya ntâye wampimaga okusêra oku ngeso za bashakulûza.<verse eid="GAL 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15"/>Ci olya wacinyîshogaga kurhenga nciri omu nda ya nyâmà, Nyamuzinda anampamagala oku nshôkano yâge, erhi alonza <verse eid="GAL 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16"/>okummanyîsa Omugala, mpu lyo nâni ngend’imuyigîriza abapagani, ho na halya, buzira kudôsa omubiri n’omukò<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omubiri n’omukò: ntà muntu ciru n’omuguma.</char></note>, <verse eid="GAL 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17"/>buzira kurheremera e Yeruzalemu emwa balya banshokoleraga okubà ntumwa, nalikûlira omu Arabiya; okuhandi nashub’ijà e Damasi. <verse eid="GAL 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18"/>Erhi hagera myâka isharhu lyo narheremirage e Yeruzalemu, nti ngend’ilolakwo Kefa; rhwabêra rhweshi naye nsiku ikumi n’irhanu. <verse eid="GAL 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19"/>Ci ntà yindi ntumwa nabwîne, okuleka Yakôbo, mwene wâbo Nyakasane. <verse eid="GAL 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20"/>Ebi mmuyandikîre, Nyamuzinda yêne amanyire oku burhali bunywesi! <verse eid="GAL 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21"/>Okuhandi nanacijà omu bihugo by’e Sîriya n’eby’e Silisiya. <verse eid="GAL 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22"/>Ci kwônene ntâl’inyishibwi omu Ekleziya za Kristu z’omu Yudeya. <verse eid="GAL 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23"/>Bakâg’iyumva baderha kwône, mpu: «Olya wakâg’irhulibuza mîra, ye kola odwîrhe ayigîriza bulya buyêmêre alonzagya okuherêrekeza». <verse eid="GAL 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24"/>Bakakuza Nnâmahanga erhi nie ntuma.<verse eid="GAL 1:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Entumwa zasîma enyigîrizo za Paolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1"/>Erhi hagera myâka ikumi n’ini, nashub’iyinamukira e Yeruzalemu rhweshi na Barnaba; nahêka na Tito. <verse eid="GAL 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2"/>Nyamuzinda wantumagayo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amubonekera.</char></note>. Nababwîra Emyanzi y’Akalembe nyigîriza abapagani; abagula bàbalimwo nababwîra ha­bo-hâbo, nti nankanalibirhira busha, nîsi erhi mbè nalibirhîre busha. <verse eid="GAL 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3"/>Ciru na Tito, Omugereki rhwàli rhweshi, barhamusêzagya mpu akembûlwe; <verse eid="GAL 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4"/>n’obwo hàli hayishire bene wîrhu b’obwîhambe bacîdwîrhe bône, barhujamwo bufu­nda mpu bayish’ihengûza kurhi rhubà ntagengwa muli Kristu banashub’irhugalula omu bujà. <verse eid="GAL 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5"/>Ci rhurhacîlîkiriraga ciru n’ehisanzi hisungunu hyône nti rhubayêmêre, lyo rhummuhisakwo Emyanzi y’Akalembe nk’oku enali. <verse eid="GAL 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6"/>Nabo abagula bâli muli bo, -Oku bâli omu bwôrhere bwâbo kurhanyêrekiri, bulya Nyamuzinda arhajira kabôlo, - abo bagula ntâco bansêzize okujira. <verse eid="GAL 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7"/>Ciru babona oku nahâbirwe omukolo gw’okuyigîriza bantakembûlwa Emyanzi y’Akalembe kulyâla Petro ahâbirwe ogw’okuyigîriza abakembûle; <verse eid="GAL 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8"/>bulya owa­rhumaga Petro emwa abakembûle, ye wantumaga nâni emwa abapagani. <verse eid="GAL 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9"/>Erhi babona engalo nashobwîre, Yakôbo na Kefa na Yowane, bo bâli nka mitungo, barhuhà okuboko, nie ono na Barnaba, mpu cibè cimanyîso c’ecinyabuguma. Rhwayumvanya oku rhw’ono rhwajà emwa abapagani, nabo e­mwa abakembûle. <verse eid="GAL 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10"/>Bakenyi bône barhubwîzire mpu rhurhayibagiraga; n’okwo kushîbirira nkushîbirira bwenêne.<verse eid="GAL 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Petro bo na Paolo e Antiyokiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11"/>Ci erhi Kefa aciyisha e Antiyokiya, namuhagalika, bulya àli akwânîne okulongozibwa. <verse eid="GAL 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12"/>bulya embere abantu ba Yakôbo bayishe, Petro akâg’ilya haguma n’abapagani; ci erhi bayisha, acîyêgûla anacîyungula erhi kuyôboha abakembûle kurhuma. <verse eid="GAL 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13"/>Abandi Buyahudi nabo bamushimba omu bulyâlya bwâge; mâshi ciru na Barnaba abalolerakwo.<verse eid="GAL 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14"/>Erhi mbona oku olugendo lwâbo lurhashimbiri okuli kw’Emyanzi y’Akalembe, nabwîra Kefa embere za boshi, nti: Akabà we Muyahudi, odwîrhe wajira nka mupagani, ci arhali nka Muyahudi, kurhi wankacîsêza abapagani mpu bajire nka Buyahudi? <verse eid="GAL 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15"/>'Rhwono rhwaburhagwa Buyahudi, rhurhali aka abâla bapagani banya-­byâha. <verse eid="GAL 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16"/>Ci bulya rhumanyire oku muntu arhajirwa mwêru-kwêru n’ebijiro by’Irhegeko; ci omu kuyêmêra Yezu Kristu, nîrhu rhwayêmîre Yezu Kristu, nti lyo rhuhinduka bêru-kwêru omu kuyêmêra Kristu, ci arhali omu kushimba Irhegeko; bulya ntà muntu wankahinduka mwêru-kwêru n’ebijiro by’Irhegeko. <verse eid="GAL 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17"/>Ci, omu kulonza okubà bêru-kwêru muli Kristu, akabà rhuciri banya-byâha, ka erhi Kristu ye okolaga odwîrhe ecâha? Ntà mango!<verse eid="GAL 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18"/>Bulya erhi nankashub’iyûbaka ecinashâbaga niene, obwo nanayêrekana oku mvunyire irhegeko. <verse eid="GAL 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19"/>Kali oku burhabâle bw’Irhegeko, nafîre, narhenzibwa omu lukoba lw’irhegeko, nti lyo ndamira Nnâmahanga: nabambirwe oku musalaba haguma na Kristu; <verse eid="GAL 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20"/>arhanaciri nie nzîne, ci Kristu ye ozîne, muli nie. N’obûla buzîne ngwêrhe buno omu mubiri, buli buzîne ngwêrhe omu kuyêmêra Mugala wa Nyamuzinda wanzigiraga anacihâna erhi nie ntuma. <verse eid="GAL 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21"/>Ntadesiri nti enshôkano ya Nyamuzinda eri busha: bulya akabà obushinga­nyanya omu Irhegeko burhenga, Kristu busha afirîre.<verse eid="GAL 2:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3"/>
  <para style="ms1">II. Enyigîrizo za Paolo emwa Abagalasiya</para>
  <para style="s1">Obushinganyanya omu buyêmêre burhenga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1"/>Yâga we, banyamerhe b’e Galasiya! Lêro ndi wammugeresire mweki we! Ka n’amasù ginyu murhabonaga nammuyigîriza Yezu Kristu wabambagwa oku musalaba? <verse eid="GAL 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2"/>Kanwa kaguma nalonza okummudôsa: ka bijiro bya marhegeko erhi kushimba obuyêmêre kwarhumaga muhâbwa Mûka Mutagatîfu? <verse eid="GAL 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3"/>Kurhi oku mwahûsirage omurhima, erhi murhangira kuli Mûka muyûkiza kuli cikoba! <verse eid="GAL 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4"/>kw’ebyo byoshi mwâbà ntamira-busha, akabà busha mwanarhamîrage! <verse eid="GAL 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5"/>Olya ommushobôza Mûka n’okujira ebisômerîne ekarhî kinyu, ka bijiro bya marhegeko birhuma akujira, nîsi erhi bulya mushimba obuyêmêre? <verse eid="GAL 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6"/>Ntyôla kwo Abrahamu ayêmîre Nnâmahanga, n’okwo kwarhuma abà mushinganyanya<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3, 6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Murh 15, 6</ref>.</char></note>. <verse eid="GAL 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7"/>Mumanyage oku abagwêrhe obuyêmêre, bônene bo bâna b’A­brahamu. <verse eid="GAL 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8"/>Na kulya kubà Amandiko gàli gamanyire oku Nyamuzinda anayêze abapagani erhi buyêmêre burhuma, gabwîra Abrahamu kurhenga mîra, mpu:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3, 8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:18">Murh 18, 18</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 12:3">12, 3</ref>.</char></note> <char style="qt">Amashanja goshi ganagishwe muli we</char>. <verse eid="GAL 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9"/>Kuziga abagwêrhe obuyêmêre, bônene bo banagishwe bo n’omwemêzi Abrahamu. Irhegeko lirhuma abantu bahehêrerwa <verse eid="GAL 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10"/>Nabo balya bacîkubagira ebijiro by’amarhegeko, bali omu kaga k’okuyish’ihehêrerwa, bulya kuyandisirwe, mpu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3, 10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:10">3, 10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 27:26">Lush 27, 26</ref>. </char></note>: <char style="qt">Ahehêrerwe ngasi yêshi orhasêra oku biyandisirwe omu citabu c’Amarhegeko byoshi.</char> <verse eid="GAL 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11"/>Ntyo kubonekîne n’obwâlagale oku ntâye amarhegeko gankajira mwêru-kwêru embere za Nyamuzinda, bulya obuzîne bw’omushinganyanya bubà buyêmêre. <verse eid="GAL 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12"/>Amarhegeko gôhe garhayegemera buyêmêre, ci ogashimba, ganamulamye<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amarhegeko garhayegemera buyêmêre, ci bijiro by’omuntu.</char></note>. <verse eid="GAL 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13"/>Kristu arhufumize okuhehêrerwa kw’amarhegeko, erhi yêne ayêmêra okuhehêrerhwa rhwe rhurhumire, bulya kuyandisirwe, mpu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3, 13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 21:23">Lush 21, 23</ref>.</char></note>: <char style="qt">Ahehêrerwe ngasi yêshi oli munanike oku murhi!</char> <verse eid="GAL 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14"/>Byabîre ntyo mpu lyo omugisho gw’Abrahamu guhika oku bapagani muli Yezu Kristu, lyo rhunahâbwa Mûka Mutagatîfu rhwalaganyibagwa erhi buyêmêre burhuma.<verse eid="GAL 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Irhegeko lirharhenzagya endagâno</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15"/>Bene wîrhu, nkola nasbambâla nka kulya abantu bashambâla. Akanwa kazinda -n’obwo kali kanwa ka muntu kwône- ntâye wankakagalula erhi okukayushulakwo ebindi, casinga kabè kafundike. <verse eid="GAL 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16"/>Amalaganyo Abrahamu wagahâbagwa n’iburha lyâge. Amandiko garhadesiri, mpu: «n’abâna bâge», nka kuno bali banji, ci: «n’iburha lyâwe», nka kuno ali muguma, ye Kristu. <verse eid="GAL 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17"/>Alagi oku ndesire: akanwa kafundikagwa na Nyamuzinda, amarhegeko gayishaga myâka magana anni na makumi asharhu kurhenga ako kanwa, garhankakagalula, garhankanarhenza ago malaganyo. <verse eid="GAL 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18"/>Bulya acibâga irhegeko lihâna akashambala, cirhankacibire ciragâne cikahâna. Ci ciragâne carhumaga Abrahamu arhonyibwa na Nnâmahanga.<verse eid="GAL 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Omukolo gw’Irhegeko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19"/>Irhegeko lirigi lya bici? Lyadwîrhwe erhi byâha birhuma, kuhika liyishe lirya iburha lyalaganyibagwa eciragâne; lyamanyisibwa na bamalahika oku bulagizi bw’omwimangizi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Oyo mwimangizi, ye Mûsa.</char></note>. <verse eid="GAL 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20"/>Ci omulagizi arhabà wa muntu muguma, na Nyamuzinda yêhe ali muguma<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omulagizi ayimanga ekarhî ka bantu babiri: owasengerwa n’owasengera.</char></note> yêne<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Co cirhumire endagâno yâge erhajira wundi mulagizì orhali yêne. Irhegeko lyôhe lyamanyisibagwa n’abalagizi, co cinarhumire lirhali limâna ak’eciragâne.</char></note>. <verse eid="GAL 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21"/>Ka kuligi kuderha oku Irhegeko lyankalwîsa eciragâne ca Nyamuzinda? Ntà mango! Hacibaga irhegeko lyankahash’ihâna obuzîne, lyoki obushinganyanya bwankarhenzire omu Marhegeko. <verse eid="GAL 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22"/>Ci Amandiko gashwêkîre ebintu byoshi omu bugomi bw’ecâha, mpu lyo abemêzi bashobôla ebyalaganyibagwa erhi buyêmêre bwâbo muli Yezu Kristu burhuma.<verse eid="GAL 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Omukolo gw’obuyêmêre</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23"/>Amango obuyêmêre burhàli buj’iyisha, rhwàli babohe omu mpamikwa y’Irhegeko, rhwakalinga oku rhwafulûlirwa obuyêmêre. <verse eid="GAL 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24"/>Ntyo Irhegeko lyàli nka mulezi warhuhisakwo Kristu, lyo obuyêmêre burhujira bêru-kwêru. <verse eid="GAL 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25"/>Ci bunôla obuyêmêre bwayishire, ntà buhashe omulezi acirhugwêrhekwo. <verse eid="GAL 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26"/>Bulya mweshi muli bâna ba Nyamuzinda erhi buyêmêre muli Kristu burhuma; <verse eid="GAL 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27"/>kulya kubà mwe mwabatizibwe muli Kristu mweshi, mwacîhundikîre Kristu. <verse eid="GAL 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28"/>Murhacirimwo Muyahudi erhi Mugereki; murhacirimwo mujà erhi ntagengwa; murhacirimwo mulume erhi mukazi: mweshi muli muguma muli Kristu Yezu. <verse eid="GAL 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29"/>N’akabà muli ba Kristu, muli iburha ly’Abrahamu, mwe mwanayîme mwa birya alaganyibagwa.<verse eid="GAL 3:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Rhurhali bajà, ci bâna ba Nnâmahanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1"/>Ndesire nti omwâna wayish’iyîma omu by’îshe, amango aciri murhò ntâco alusha ecibwindi, n’obwo eby’îshe byoshi biri byâge; <verse eid="GAL 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2"/>Ci anarhang’ikarhegekwa n’abalezi n’abalanzi bâge, kuhika amango îshe alonza. <verse eid="GAL 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3"/>Nîrhu kwo na kuguma: amango rhwaciri barhò, rhwàli bajà b’ebiremwa by’en’igulu. <verse eid="GAL 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4"/>Ci amango Nnâmahanga ali atwîre erhi gayunjula, arhuma Omugala waburhagwa n’omukazi, aburhwa amango g’Irhegeko, <verse eid="GAL 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5"/>mpu lyo acungula abàli bashwêsirwe n’Irhegeko, anarhujire bâna ba Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="GAL 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6"/>Na bulya muli bâna bâge, Nyamuzinda ahizire omu mirhima yîrhu Omûka gw’Omugala gukayakûza, mpu: «Abba, Larha!» <verse eid="GAL 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7"/>Ntyo orhaciri mujà, ci mwâna muburhe, n’akabà oli mwâna muburhe, wayish’ihâbwa na Nyamuzinda okuyîma.<verse eid="GAL 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8"/>Galya mango murhàl’imuj’imanya Nyamuzinda, mwakâg’igashâniza abazimu, n’obwo abo bazimu barhankaba bo Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="GAL 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9"/>Lêro buno mukola muyishi Nyamuzinda, na buno naye akola ammuyishi, kurhi mwankacishimbaga ebiremwa bya busha birhajira nsimiko, n’okushub’icijira bajà bâbyo? <verse eid="GAL 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10"/>Kali kushimba mucishimba ensiku, emyêzi, amango n’emyâka! <verse eid="GAL 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11"/>Nyôbohire nti kwankanabà narhamîre busha emwinyu!<verse eid="GAL 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Olukogo lwa Paolo oku Bagalasiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12"/>Mmuhûnyire, bene wîrhu, mubè akâni, bulya nâni nacîjizire nka mwe. Ntà bubî mwanjirîre. <verse eid="GAL 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13"/>Mucikengîre oku nali mulwâla erhi nyish’immubwîriza Emyanzi y’Akalembe obw’oburhanzi. <verse eid="GAL 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14"/>n’ago magala mabî, n’obwo gwàli muzigo kuli mwe, garharhumaga mwangayaguza erhi kumbôla; ci mwanyankirira nka malahika wa Nnâmahanga, nka kulya mwankayankirira Yezu Kristu yêne. <verse eid="GAL 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15"/>Ngahi erigi erya nshagali yinyu? Leki mmuhè obu buhamîrizi: kucihashikanaga, mwankacîrhomwîre amasù, mugampe. <verse eid="GAL 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16"/>Ka lêro nkolaga mbà mushombanyi winyu okwenge nammubwîzire okuli? <verse eid="GAL 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17"/>Abo bantu badwîrhe bammunywerhera mpu bammuzigira, ci kulonza balonzize okummunanûla kuli nie, mpu babè erhi bo musêrakwo. <verse eid="GAL 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18"/>Okuyumva omuntu azigirwe kurhali kubî, casinga kubè kuzigirwa omu minjà n’ensiku zoshi, ci arhali amango ndi ekarhî kinyu gône! <verse eid="GAL 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19"/>Rhwâna rhwâni, ndwîrhe nayumva amalumwa g’okushub’immuburha, kuhika Kristu akomere omu mirhima yinyu. <verse eid="GAL 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20"/>Ciru ncibaga ekarhî kinyu buno, nkahindula izù lyâni, bulya ntacimanyiri kurhi nammujira!<verse eid="GAL 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Endagâno ya mîra n’endagâno mpyâhya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21"/>Mbwîragi nâni, mwe mwalonza okushub’ishwêkwa n’Irhegeko, ka murhasâg’iliyumva eryo Irhegeko? <verse eid="GAL 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22"/>Kuyandisirwe mpu Abrahamu ali agwêrhe bâna babiri, muguma w’oku mujà, owundi wa kuli mukâge w’obuhya. <verse eid="GAL 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23"/>Oyo mwâna w’omujà-kazi aburhagwa buzira ciragâne, ci mugala wa mukâge w’obuhya yêhe aburhagwa ciragâne ca Nyamuzinda cirhumire<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abo bâna babiri, bo Ismaeli, oburhwa oku mujà-kazi, n’Izaki oburhwa oku mukazi w’obuhya.</char></note>. <verse eid="GAL 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24"/>Luli lwinganyo olwo: abo bakazi zo ndagâno oku ziri ibiri. Entanzi, yarhengaga oku ntondo Sînayi, n’iburha lyâyo liri lya bujà: ye Hagari, - <verse eid="GAL 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25"/>bulya Sînayi omu Arabiya abà, - ye Yeruzalemu wa buno, oli mujà bo n’abâna bâge. <verse eid="GAL 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26"/>Yeruzalemu w’enyanya yêhe arhali mujà, ye nyâmà. <verse eid="GAL 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27"/>Bulya kuyandisirwe, mpu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4, 27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:1">Iz 54, 1</ref>.</char></note>: <char style="qt">Oshagaluke we ngumba erhaburha</char>; <char style="qt">osîme onacîshinge we rhishi mikero</char>; <char style="qt">bulya abâna b’omusho­mbè-kazi bali banji kulusha ab’omurhonyi</char>. <verse eid="GAL 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28"/>Mw’oyo, bene wîrhu. muli bâna ba ciragâne ak’Izaki. <verse eid="GAL 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29"/>Ci nka kulya omwâna waburhagwa buzira ciragâne akâg’ishoshôba omwâna w’eciragâne, ntyo kwo binaciri kuhik’ene. <verse eid="GAL 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30"/>Ci kurhi Amandiko gadesire? <char style="qt">Hulusa omujà-kazi bo n’Omugala</char>, <char style="qt">bulya omwâna w’omu­jà-kazi arhankayîma bo na mugala wa mukâwe w’okuli</char><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4, 30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:10">Murh 21, 10</ref>.</char></note>. <verse eid="GAL 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31"/>Ntyo, bene wîrhu, rhurhali bâna ba mujà, ci rhuli bâna b’omukazi w’obuhya bw’okuli.<verse eid="GAL 4:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5"/>
  <para style="ms1">III. Okufundika</para>
  <para style="s1">Omukristu abà ntagengwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1"/>Kristu arhurhenzize omu bujà mpu lyo rhubà bantagengwa. Muzibuhage, mumanye mwankacicîshubiza omu muzigo gw’bujà. <verse eid="GAL 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2"/>Niene Paolo mmubwizirekwo: erhi mwankakembûlwa, ntâco Kristu acimmumalira. <verse eid="GAL 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3"/>Nêci, nshubir’ihamîriza oku ngasi muntu okembûlwa, arhegesirwe ashimbe Irhegeko lyoshi. <verse eid="GAL 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4"/>Mwe mulonza obushinganyanya omu kushimba Irhegeko, mwacîrhenzizekwo Kristu, mwarhêzire enshôkano ya Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="GAL 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5"/>Rhwêhe, obushinganyanya rhulangâlira, Mûka Mutagatîfu rhubulongezakwo omu buyêmêre. <verse eid="GAL 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6"/>Kali, muli Kristu, arhali kukembûlwa kujira akamalo, ci obuyêmêre buciyêrekana omu buzigire. <verse eid="GAL 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7"/>Amashigwe ginyu gàli garhangire bwinjà! Ndi wacimuhanzizagye okushimba eby’okuli? <verse eid="GAL 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8"/>Arhali olya wammuhamagalaga ye wammuhâga eryo ihano. <verse eid="GAL 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9"/>Olwango lutyanguli, n’obuntu bwanabumbugurha bwoshi! <verse eid="GAL 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10"/>Niehe nnangâlîre muli Nyakasane nti murhakengêre kundi-kundi. Ci olya odwîrhe ammuhiramwo akavulindi, ciru akabà yè ndi, ahanwa. <verse eid="GAL 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11"/>Nie oyûla, bene wîrhu, ciru akabà ncihanûla okukembûlwa, cirhuma bacija bandibuza? Kuziga okusârhazibwa n’omusalaba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omusalaba lyo iriba ly’obuzîne n’obucire. Ci ogwo musalaba ziri nshonyì oku Buyahudi, n’oku bapagani liri isirhe (gwârhi <char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 1:23">1 Kor 1, 23</ref></char>).</char></note> lêro kukola kuhwîre! <verse eid="GAL 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12"/>Abôla badwîrhe bammuhira­mwo akavulindi; kali bacîshahule erhi kwo!<verse eid="GAL 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okurhabâlana omu buzigire n’okuleka Mûka Mutagatîfu yêne akarhuhêka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13"/>Mwêhe, bene wîrhu, mwahamagîrwe mpu mubè ntagengwa. Ci mumanye okwo kubà ntagengwa kurhabâga igwârhiro ly’okushimbulira amasîma g’omu­biri; ci ngasi muguma akarhumikira abâbo omu buzigire. <verse eid="GAL 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14"/>Kali amarhegeko goshi mw’eri liguma gabà: <char style="qt">Ozigire owinyu nk’oku ocîzigira wêne</char>. <verse eid="GAL 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15"/>Ci akabà munakashoshôbana n’okulyâna mwêne na nnene, mumanye mwahezanya!<verse eid="GAL 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16"/>Co cirhumire mmubwîra: muleke Mûka Mutagatîfu akammuhêka, na ntyo murhashimbe amasîma g’omubiri. <verse eid="GAL 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17"/>Bulyâla omubiri gurhumvanya n’omûka, n’omûka gurhumvanya n’omubiri; byombi birhabonanakwo, co cinarhuma murhajira ebimulonzize. <verse eid="GAL 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18"/>Ci kwône erhi mwankakulikira Mûka Mutagatîfu, murhaciri omu bujà bw’Irhegeko.<verse eid="GAL 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19"/>Na ntâye ohabire ebijiro by’omubiri: okuhusha, obumaguza, okujira eby’enshonyi, <verse eid="GAL 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20"/>okurherekêra abazimu, okujira eby’obukurungu, okushombana, akavulindi, obuyâgalwa, obukunizi, ennongwè, okurhayumvanya, okucîberamwo, <verse eid="GAL 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21"/>okucîfinja ebya bene, endalwè, obudambi n’ebindi bya bene ebyo. Nshubir’immukengeza, nka kulya na­mmubwîraga, oku abajira ntyo barhakalabarha omu Bwâmi hwa Nyamuzinda.<verse eid="GAL 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22"/>Ebijiro bya Mûka Mutagatîfu byôhe buli buzigire, bushagaluke, murhûla, kulemberana, lukogo, bwinjà, kurhatwa omu kanwa kîrhu, <verse eid="GAL 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23"/>butûdu, bucêse bw’omurhima. Nt’irhegeko lyankahanza bya bene ebyo. <verse eid="GAL 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24"/>Balya bali bambali ba Kristu babambire emibiri yâbo haguma n’amashumi n’amîru gâyo.<verse eid="GAL 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25"/>Akabà Mûka Mutagatîfu ye buzîne bwîrhu, rhuhêkwe na Mûka omu lugendo lwîrhu. <verse eid="GAL 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26"/>Rhurhakâg’icîlongeza obukuze burhali bwo; rhuleke okukahalalirana n’okuyâgalwa n’abirhu.<verse eid="GAL 5:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Amahano gayêrekîre obuzigire n’obukombêdu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1"/>Bene wîrhu, ciru omuntu ankagwârhwa omu câha, mwe bâna ba Mûka, munamuyigîrize n’olukogo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Oyigîrize ohirimire omu câha n’olukogo: Irhegeko lya mîra lyalihunyire okuniga omunya-byâha.</char></note>; ci omanye wankagwa omu mashumi nâwe! <verse eid="GAL 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2"/>Ngasi muguma abarhule omuzigo gw’owâbo, na ntyo mwayunjuza irhegeko lya Kristu. <verse eid="GAL 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3"/>Ocîkubagira mpu omuntu naye hali oku ali, n’obwo ntâkwo ali, erhi kucîrheba acîrhebire yêne. <verse eid="GAL 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4"/>Ngasi muguma agere omukolo gwâge, na ntyo alongeze obukuze omu murhima gwâge yêne, ci arhabulongezagya oku bandi; <verse eid="GAL 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5"/>bulya ngasi muguma ajira ogwâge muzigo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">«Kuli kuderha oku ngasi muguma muli rhwe anabûlane yêne embere za Nnâmahanga» (gwârhi <char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 14:12">Rom 14, 12</ref></char>).</char></note>.<verse eid="GAL 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6"/>Owayigîrizibwa akanwa ka Kristu, kukwânîne bagabâne ebirugu byâge bo n’owayigîriza. <verse eid="GAL 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7"/>Murhakâg’icîrheba: Nyamuzinda arhashekerwa. Bulya ebi omuntu arhwêraga by’anasârûla. <verse eid="GAL 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8"/>Orhwêra omu mubiri, ayish’isârûlamwo ebibolêreza; ci orhwêra muli Mûka, ayish’isârûla muli Mûka obuzîne bw’ensiku n’amango. <verse eid="GAL 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9"/>Rhurharhamaga okukâjira aminjà. Rhwacisârûla omu mango gakwânîne rhukabà rhurhashubiri nyuma. <verse eid="GAL 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10"/>Ntyo, bunôla rhucigwêrhe amango, rhukajirira abantu boshi aminjà, bwenêne bene wîrhu omu buyêmêre.<verse eid="GAL 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">lshwinjiro ly’ebinwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11"/>Ka mubwîne ebiherufi binênênè mmuyandikîre n’okuboko kwâni! <verse eid="GAL 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12"/>Balyâla bakâlonza okusîmwa n’abantu, bâbo bo badwîrhe bammusêza mpu mukembûlwe, n’okwo kwoshi mpu barhag’ilibuzibwa erhi musalaba gwa Kristu gurhuma. <verse eid="GAL 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13"/>Kali ciru n’abakembûle bône barhashimba Irhegeko; ci basîma mukembûlwe, mpu lyo emibiri yinyu mikembûle ebahà igwârhiro ly’okucîkunga. <verse eid="GAL 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14"/>Niehe, mâshi ntacifaga nalonzize obukuze omu kandi kantu ogurhali musalaba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">lgulu ly’ebyâha. Rhwabambirwe haguma na Yezu oku musalaba. </char></note> gwa Nnawîrhu Yezu Kristu, ye warhumaga igulu lyabambwa kuli nie, nâni nabambwa oku igulu! <verse eid="GAL 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15"/>Bulya okukembûlwa kuli ntâco, n’okurhakembûlwa nakwo kuli ntâco; akantu kagwêrhe akamalo, kuli kuhinduka ciremwa cihyâhya. <verse eid="GAL 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16"/>Abashimba eryo irhegeko, omurhûla n’obwonjo bwa Nyamuzinda kuli bo boshi, na kuli Israheli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Israheli wa Nnâmahanga, gwo mulala gw’abemêzi boshi, abarhengaga omu Buyahudi n’omu barhali Buyahudi, boshi bakola bâna ba Abrahamu bayish’iyîma haguma na Kristu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 3:27-29">3, 27-29</ref></char>).</char></note> wa Nnâmahanga. <verse eid="GAL 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17"/>Lêro kurhenga ene ntâye ocikag’iderha mpu antabirakwo; bulya ebimanyîso bya Yezu biri biyandike omu mubiri gwâni. <verse eid="GAL 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18"/>Enshôkano ya Nnawîrhu Yezu Kristu ebêre omu mirhima yinyu, bene wîrhu! Amen!<verse eid="GAL 6:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6"/>
</usx>
